 "caption": "The second cipher passage of Jourdan’s letter to Soult (lines D1–D8 of the transcription), in the Spanish copy AHN DIVERSOS-COLECCIONES,134,N.34, image 2 (PARES 3156392): from “Vous sentez, monsieur le maréchal” to “au pont de l’Arzobispo”.",
